<title>FRANCE: Gen de Eaux plans telecom investment.</title>
<headline>Gen de Eaux plans telecom investment.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux plans to invest four billion francs per year in telecommunications from 1997 to 1999, of which 2.3 billion will be in mobile phones, chairman Jean-Marie Messier said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
